OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers soon easing off for
OL,7,Fmost, but showers may continue along
OL,8,Fsouthern coastal areas. Some clear
OL,9,Fspells overnight, but cloud thickening
OL,10,Fin the west with rain arriving towards
OL,11,Fdawn. Windy along southern coasts.
OL,12,FMild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FCoastal showers at first in
OL,15,Fthe east. Rain in the west moving
OL,16,Facross all parts during the morning,
OL,17,Fthis occasionally heavy and perhaps
OL,18,Fthundery, likely clearing during the
OL,19,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
